1226
01:43:24,438 --> 01:43:25,438
"Berbaringlah."

1227
01:43:29,707 --> 01:43:30,714
Dan dia...

1228
01:43:33,646 --> 01:43:35,213
Dia...

1229
01:43:41,955 --> 01:43:43,485
Ibu bilang, aku tak boleh menceritakannya.

1230
